WEBVTT

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:50.250
<b><i>Dreamer's Symphony</i></b>

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:05.010
You want me to appear in an advertisement?

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:07.890
Yes.

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:12.090
The committee members aren't the only ones

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:15.960
who have the right to vote, you know.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:18.360
I know. The audience members do, as well.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:23.210
Don't you think making as many fans as possible

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:26.370
will be advantageous in this fight?

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.950
Well...

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:31.900
The battle has already begun.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:35.860
You must do your best. Understand?

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:36.830
I understand.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.800
Give it everything you have!

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:40.880
President,

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.400
can I ask you something?

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:45.680
Yes, ask me anything.

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:50.510
You gave Nanami's songs to HE☆VENS because

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:52.350
you wanted it to be a fair fight...

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.590
Is that really the only reason?

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:59.610
That's right, of course. What other reason could I have?

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:02.610
Never mind.

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:04.150
It's nothing.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:12.890
I wouldn't expect any less of you, Mr. Ichinose.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.970
<i>I will never have another meeting like this.</i>

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:34.390
<i>Starting today, the seven of you are the new ST☆</i>RISH!

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:40.920
<i>ST☆</i>RISH will disband soon by our hand.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:06.170
What's going on?

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:17.290
<i>I need to make a song that can beat anything.</i>

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:27.690
Miss Nanami, whether they live or die depends on your arrangement.

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.980
What? Nanami is...?

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:59.010
Yes. She doesn't seem to be acting like her usual self.

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.180
I couldn't even talk to her.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:05.570
She's been cooped up in her room this whole time.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.270
The arrangement is an important job.

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:11.840
And our dissolution depends on it...

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.280
She must be experiencing a lot of pressure.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.920
We're talking about Nanami.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.370
She must be trying to handle it all herself.

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:20.070
What?

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.790
Haru? By herself?

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:27.080
Lady doesn't tell us anything when she's in pain.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:36.750
Haru, you finished your arrangement.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.580
Let me see it.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.720
This is amazing.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:45.750
Haru, when did you learn such sophisticated techniques?

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.820
Its overall balance is good too.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.860
It's amazing.

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.460
Thank goodness...

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:53.720
But...

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:01.360
It might have been better the first time I heard it.

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:02.850
What?

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:04.870
It's difficult to explain.

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:08.660
I feel like it lost something.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:14.060
Like excitement, or energy.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:25.510
<i>What am I going to do?</i>

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.190
Ichinose.

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:40.400
Welcome back. Where is everyone else?

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.570
They still have work to do.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.280
I see.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.410
Nanami.

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:57.060
If you're so inclined, will you come here tonight?

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:02.450
I will sing the song you gave me.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:03.800
What?

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:21.380
Is this the right place?

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:24.490
<i>At the president's request, it's also an advertisement...</i>

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:27.030
<i>But I want you to hear it.</i>

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:31.490
<i>I know you're busy working on the arrangement...</i>

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.260
<i>But...</i>

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.250
<i>isn't taking a break part of that work?</i>

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:50.430
<i>I met HAYATO here.</i>

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:05.110
<i>It seems like it happened so long ago.</i>

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:11.350
Good evening, everyone.

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:13.120
I am Ichinose Tokiya of ST☆RISH.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:15.620
Look at that!

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.330
You're kidding!

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:17.620
It's Tokiya!

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:23.230
Tonight, I want you to be the only one to hear my song.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.160
<i>Ichinose...</i>

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:09.020
That song was wonderful!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.760
He seemed a little different, but it was so exciting.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.030
Is that Tokiya's new song?

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:17.950
<i>This is my assignment.</i>

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:21.290
<i>I will make it a song I can be proud of.</i>

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.370
Ichinose.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.680
Oh, excuse me.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:33.040
Are you all right?

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:39.170
Good evening.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:41.180
Ichi...!

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:45.560
We'll attract attention. This way.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:10:59.990
A festival.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.110
Let's go.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:07.880
But I...

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:15.170
I... I'm so sorry.

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:17.370
Don't be modest. Go ahead.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.920
Okay.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.680
Have you been eating properly?

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.390
Well...

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.730
You're unbelievable...

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:32.350
When you're focused on work, you're incapable of taking care of yourself.

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:36.980
Here. They're getting cold.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:45.820
A person like you needs someone by her side.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:52.410
I'll stay with you the rest of the night. Let's go.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.020
Um...

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.360
Thank you for today.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.680
It was a lot of fun.

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:52.220
I see.

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:56.870
And that song was wonderful.

00:12:56.870 --> 00:13:00.380
It seemed a little different from the ones you've sung before.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:04.850
You brought out

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.400
my potential.

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:13.330
I thought I needed to change something in order to sing that song.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:19.580
The truth is, I've always been curious

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:22.420
about HAYATO.

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:25.670
Ichinose...

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:32.380
It may have been work, but HAYATO was born inside of me.

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:37.750
I thought I needed to accept him as a part of me

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:41.100
in order to sing this song.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:45.170
That's why that song...

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:47.020
That's amazing, Ichinose.

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.410
Really.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:53.880
I had no idea

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:57.610
you were working so hard...

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.900
I...

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:08.670
I will do anything to sing your songs.

00:14:10.770 --> 00:14:12.300
Ichinose.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:16.240
I'll do my best too.

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.890
I'll make a song that will beat HE☆VENS.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:22.310
Beat them?

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:27.310
Nanami, what could make you say something like that?

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:33.800
I won't let you be disbanded.

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:41.510
Calm down, Nanami.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:46.960
I love them.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:51.170
I love the songs you write.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.670
I love the music of your true self.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:04.260
Do you remember what you told me?

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:06.930
<i>I love your songs!</i>

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:09.520
<i>The songs of your true self!</i>

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:11.230
<i>Please...</i>

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:15.900
<i>Sing for me.</i>

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:27.450
I am who I am now because of you.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:32.800
I took those words to heart.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:38.880
I promised I would use my voice to make people happy.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.930
<i>Make people happy?</i>

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:50.850
<i>I will work hard to write songs that will make people happy.</i>

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:57.340
<i>I need to make a song that can beat anything.</i>

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.360
I...

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:02.980
I...

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:05.910
Nanami!

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.800
I...

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:17.140
lost sight of the most important thing...

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:24.400
I'm sorry.

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:31.140
I've failed as a professional.

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:34.430
Nanami.

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:36.730
It's all right.

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:40.080
Everyone loses sight of themselves sometimes.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.190
Don't worry about it.

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:44.810
No...

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.180
No...

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:05.010
Don't try to take on everything by yourself anymore.

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:18.390
I want you to share your pain with me.

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:25.360
Ichinose.

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.350
I will.

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:43.250
Ichinose, thank you. I...

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:45.240
Nanami.

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:50.760
I'm not the only one who was worried.

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:50.710
What are you doing here?

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.760
Don't act so distant.

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:55.460
We couldn't just ignore you when we knew you were worried.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:01.590
We thought of what we could do for you together.

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:05.270
The only thing we can do for you

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:09.950
is provide the greatest vocals for your song.

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:13.520
At the very least, we wanted you to know how much we care about you.

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:17.940
We wrote lyrics for your song that the president brought

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:20.110
when we were camping.

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:22.570
Everyone...

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:28.990
Haruka, our hearts will always connect to yours.

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:32.790
Everyone...

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:37.100
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:40.510
Thank you.

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:45.820
Such a beautiful song...

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:47.190
Nanami.

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:48.350
Haru.

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.150
Nanami.

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:51.350
Lady.

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:57.080
I'm so happy... I...

00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:01.320
I'll put everything I'm feeling into my arrangement!

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:04.870
All right!

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:09.280
We'll sing with all the happiness we have when we sing that song!

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:14.960
Okay!

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:21.260
Okay, then. Let's watch some fireworks together.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:22.130
Fireworks?

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:27.930
We planned to invite you to watch fireworks with us.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.790
Icchi surprised us

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:32.850
by saying he'd invite you himself, so we left him to it.

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:35.240
He was late, wasn't he?

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:39.300
What were you doing, Tokiya?

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:43.460
I have nothing to say.

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:44.230
Ichinose.

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:48.230
Icchi, you'd better not be trying to get a step ahead.

00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:50.240
I didn't do anything.

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:51.740
Tokiya?

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:54.200
Why don't you tell us the details?

00:21:55.360 --> 00:21:57.660
There's no need for that.

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:00.840
Tokiya, spit it out!

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:01.360
Tell us, Tokiya!

00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:02.670
Cut it out!

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:05.110
Um, guys...

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:17.270
Fantastic!

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:19.240
Amazing!

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:25.020
<i>This happy feeling...</i>

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:30.190
<i>I'll put all of it into my music!</i>

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:31.050
<i>I just know it...</i>
